                                "sense_id": "3f2a3926-6782-332a-906a-83b8c09b1f36",
                                "text": "Uvalas are a particular type of karst closed depression. While other types of closed depression—dolines and poljes—are regularly listed and relatively well-defined in overviews of karst surface morphology, uvalas are either excluded or their vague identification is stressed"
